MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B01_m01_001: Thugs! They're infesting the tavern down below.\nWhat's this city coming to, I ask you?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B01_m01_002: It's right down the stairs. You can't miss it. But if\nyou ask me, you should do just that—miss it!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B01_m01: <BLN>What's this city coming to?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B02_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B02_B07_m01_001: Look out for Majide... He's been running amok lately.\nHe even stole from my stall!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B02_B07_m01_002: That thug! Struts around like he owns the place.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B02_B07_m01_003: He's a bad apple. Gets caught, they throw him in the\ndungeons. Gets out, ends up back in.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B02_B07_m01_004: Fell in with a new crowd lately. Scoundrels all! He\nkeeps bragging he's going to win the games too.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B02_B07_m01_005: He's grown bold and cruel. The owner's at his wits'\nend, with these ne'er-do-wells stinking up his tavern.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B02_m01: <BLN>That Majide!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B07_m01: <BLN>I don't feel safe around here!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B03_m01_001: Just the other day, Majide beat a warrior called\nDallos within an inch of his life.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B03_m01_002: Ever since then Dallos has been jumping at\nshadows!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B03_m01_003: The whole thing gives me the creeps. What did\nMajide DO to the poor fellow?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B03_m01: <BLN>What happened to him?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_Mic_m01_004: I can't believe how many people there are in\nthis city!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_Mic_m01_008: Oh, right. It's your first time in Dagsion, isn't it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_Mic_m01_005: Yeah. I've lived my whole life in the tail end of\nnowhere. I'm a fisher's daughter, after all.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_Mic_m01_006: You remind me of when I first came to the city, now\nthat I think about it.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Esm_m02: <BLN>People everywhere!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Mic_m02: <BLN>Your first time here?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Hur_Arena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Hur_Arena_001: Your match will take place on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.\nCome back on the appointed day, OK?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Hur_Arena_m01: <BLN>Your next match...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m01_001: I cannot comprehend your thinking. Nor can I\nimagine this will go well.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m01_002: This notion that everything can be solved through\nstrength...it is called barbarism. Think on that!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Fab_m01: <BLN>A foolish plan!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m01_001: This city is AMAZING! Don't you think so, Sweetie?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m01_002: But we're not having much luck finding a competitor\nfor the games, are we?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m01_003: Oh well! If we keep looking around, we'll bump into\nsomebody sooner or later.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Esm_m01: <BLN>Let's look around.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m02_001: Dagsion, the imperial capital. I have been here before\non occasion. Each time, the same thought strikes.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m02_002: These beasts, who have no technology, have built a\nremarkable metropolis—a praiseworthy feat.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m02_003: It is a towering edifice to indulgence only the\nsurface world could hold. Yes, I shall leave it at that.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Fab_m02: <BLN>Praiseworthy, indeed.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Urs_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Urs_m01_001: Talimun and I were supposed to have a meeting\nabout the Saint Merida branch.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Urs_m01_002: *sigh* But, as always, the slightest hint of mundane\nbusiness, and he's made himself scarce.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Urs_m01_003: If I know him at all, he's likely dawdling in lowtown.\nI'll have to send someone to drag him back.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Urs_m01: <BLN>Oh, Talimun...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Tal_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Tal_m01_001: Well, speak of the devil himself! Looking sharp\nas always, my friend.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Tal_m01_002: I trust you'll take care of business. Meet me here on\nthe {SetColor=Gold}evening of Maresh 21{SetColor=Default}, yes?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Tal_m01_003: Hm? Ursula's looking for me? Ha! Now that you\nmention it, it did feel like I was forgetting something.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Tal_m01: <BLN>As far as my match goes...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Anh_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Anh_m01_001: Oh?! You've come here too?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Anh_m01_002: I warn you not to involve yourselves with us.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Anh_m01_003: You are affiliates of Vritra, our enemy.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Anh_m01: <BLN>I warn you.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Naz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Naz_m01_001: Huh, never expected to see you here. So, you're\nentering the Heroic Games?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Naz_m01_002: Now this is interesting! Looks like we'll be settling\nour score in the arena.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Naz_m01: <BLN>Now this is interesting!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Hal_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Hal_m01_001: Ahh! You're the scary person from before!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Hal_m01_002: You, uh, wouldn't maybe go and cut someone down\nin the street? Would you?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Hal_m01: <BLN>Ahhh!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Maj_m01_001: Y-you're that guy from that other time!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Maj_m01_002: You stinkin' cheat! How dare you rob me, the\ngreat Majide, of my big chance?!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Maj_m01_003: Just you wait! One of these days I'm gonna\nGET you—and get you BAD!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Maj_m01: <BLN>Just you wait!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Yan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Yan_m01_001: I noticed you observing me a while ago. Have you\nneed of me in some way?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Yan_m01: <BLN>Have you need of me?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m03_001: Let us head to the arena.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m03_002: We need only speak to someone to find out whether\nthat woman from the tavern was telling the truth.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Fab_m03_003: I would willingly stake a ration of salted sheep's milk\ncheese that her words were a mere prevarication.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Fab_m03: <BLN>Shall we see?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m03_001: You know, I like it around here.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m03_004: It's still PART of the city, but you can head to the\ndocks and watch the boats come and go.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m03_002: This city is full of heavy-handed people who like to\nthrow around their authority, though, isn't it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Esm_m03_003: If there's one thing I can't stand, it's people who look\ndown on you for no good reason.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Esm_m03: <BLN>This is nice.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Mic_m01_001: The lodgings here are rough and ready, but at least\nthey're cheap.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Mic_m01_002: I'm trying to save money, so I'll put up with it.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Mic_m01_003: But I draw the line at bedbugs.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_Mic_m01_004: The moment I spotted one, I made sure they aired\nout the bedding. Nothing does the trick like sunlight!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_Mic_m01: <BLN>At least they're cheap.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B04_m01_001: My word, but you're beautiful.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B04_m01_002: Don't know what it is, but I can't take my eyes\noff you...
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B04_m01: <BLN>Beautiful...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B05_m01_001: You're so scary!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B05_m01: <BLN>Aaah!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B06_m01_001: Is this your first time in Dagsion?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B06_m01_002: Impressive, isn't it? It is no less than a paradise\ncreated by the gods.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B06_m01: <BLN>Glorious Dagsion!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B08_m01_001: I saw a guy sauntering down the street outside the\ntavern. I'm pretty sure I recognized him too.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B08_m01_002: It's been a long time since I've seen him around.\nWhen did he get back into town?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B08_m01: <BLN>Was that who I think it was?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B09_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B09_m01_001: A super-rich guy just walked past me, right down\nthe alley. He was wearing so much jewelry!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c04_B09_m01_002: Dressed in bright red, like some kind of king! I think\nhe was looking for something.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c04_B09_m01: <BLN>Who was that guy?